libfvde
------------------------------------------
libfvde is a library to access FileVault Drive Encryption (FVDE) (or
FileVault2) encrypted volumes.

Runtime requirements:
  cygfuse-3.2.0-3
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libbfio1-20260623-1bl1
  libcaes1-20261028-1bl1
  libcdata1-20260703-1bl1
  libcerror1-20260703-1bl1
  libclocale1-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify1-20260703-1bl1
  libcthreads1-20260703-1bl1
  libfcache1-20260520-1bl1
  libfdata1-20260521-1bl1
  libfguid1-20260521-1bl1
  libfplist1-20260521-1bl1
  libfvde-devel-20260923-1bl1
  libfvde1-20260923-1bl1
  libhmac1-20260522-1bl1
  libuna1-20260602-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  python312-3.12.12-1
  zlib0-1.4-1

