Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfvde

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfvde/archive/refs/tags/20260923.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libfvde-20260923-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libfvde-20260923-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libfvde-20260923-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfvde-20260923-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfvde1-20260923-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfvde-devel-20260923-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libfvde-20260923-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libfvde)
  /usr/bin/fvdeinfo.exe
  /usr/bin/fvdemount.exe
  /usr/bin/fvdewipekey.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libfvde.README
  /usr/share/doc/libfvde/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libfvde/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libfvde/COPYING.LESSER
  /usr/share/doc/libfvde/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libfvde/FileVault Drive Encryption (FVDE).asciidoc
  /usr/share/doc/libfvde/README
  /usr/share/man/man1/fvdeinfo.1.gz
  /usr/share/man/man1/fvdemount.1.gz

(libfvde1)
  /usr/bin/cygfvde-1.dll

(libfvde-devel)
  /usr/include/libfvde.h
  /usr/include/libfvde/codepage.h
  /usr/include/libfvde/definitions.h
  /usr/include/libfvde/error.h
  /usr/include/libfvde/extern.h
  /usr/include/libfvde/features.h
  /usr/include/libfvde/types.h
  /usr/lib/libfvde.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libfvde.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libfvde.3.gz

(python312-libfvde)
  /usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pyfvde.cpython-312-x86_64-cygwin.dll

